roves from run to run.\n\nKilling quickly builds a fury state that lets you rip through enemies without taking damage. You can play solo, with a friend on the same screen, or online. The developers cite Rogue Legacy, Dead Cells, Contra and Metal Slug as influences, so it suits fans of run-and-gun action and roguelites."}}